# OPSD War Room — agent integration

When pushing updates into the War Room UI or briefing operators:

1. **Read** [docs/AGENTS.md](docs/AGENTS.md) — full API schemas, curl examples, and workflows.
2. **Run** `python3 server.py 8765` (not plain `http.server`) so POST and SSE work.
3. **Push** via `POST /api/briefing`, `/api/desk`, `/api/slack`, or unified `/api/events`.

## Quick reference

| Target | Endpoint | Use for |
|--------|----------|---------|
| Operator catch-up | `POST /api/briefing` | Headline, bullets, operator focus |
| Proposal desk | `POST /api/desk` | KPIs, cancels, stamps, notes |
| Slack feed | `POST /api/slack` | `#opsd-war-room` messages |

## Sequence chart (Gantt)

Operators can **drag flight/ground bars horizontally within each tail lane** on the NetLine 7-day chart. Hour snap; local browser only — **no API for bar moves**. Mention this when guiding operators through what-if rescheduling.

Do not claim OCC write-back or live Slack/NetLine connectivity.
